      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> twice per day.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The buso touches a Small, Medium, or Large plant.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The plant grows or shrinks by one size, remaining that size for the next 5 minutes. If used on a plant creature, this effect has the effects of Enlarge or Shrink (buso's choice). Unwilling plant creatures can attempt a DC 18 Fortitude Saving Throw saving throw to resist this effect.</p>",
